{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>想認真記錄飲食，又不想把健康數據上傳雲端？YourFuelFit 是一款專為 iOS 而設的營養追蹤與智能 AI 飲食教練，適合關注體態、增肌減脂或想改善飲食習慣的用家。它採用本機優先設計，需自行提供 AI API 金鑰（如 OpenAI、Anthropic 或 Gemini）以啟用 AI 飲食指導與餐點分析，金鑰只儲存在裝置上。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n<img alt=\"限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460bb-75-171.webp\">\n<h2>私隱優先的智能營養追蹤</h2>\n<p>YourFuelFit 以環狀圖表呈現每日營養狀況，一眼掌握熱量目標、蛋白質進度與飲水量。內置 AI 教練會依當日攝取量提供個人化總結與晚間回饋，並可記錄蛋白質、碳水、脂肪及纖維、糖、鈉等微量營養素。所有記錄只儲存在裝置本機，不設雲端資料庫與帳戶，並支援鎖定畫面小工具。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-186-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-187-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-188-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-189-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-190-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-191-scaled.jpg\">\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：YourFuelFit</li>\n<li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T08:21:04.706196+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":387,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T08:04:29+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-17T03:37:32.693769+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T08:17:54.799074+00:00","content_hash":"12930737141ce0641a7f0dd4bb85c88556dec7b0c6e23bf8e87b770ac8fa7494","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}